%SIXMD 1
# @?RM - REMOVE FILES

## @?OPERANDS

### @?FILE ...
ONE OR MORE PATHS TO UNLINK.

## DESCRIPTION

RM UNLINKS EACH NAMED PATH.  DIRECTORY REMOVAL IS HANDLED BY RMDIR.
USAGE IS 'RM FILE ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
